# Vercel turns every file under the root `api/` directory into a Serverless
# Function. The app needs exactly one, so `api/` holds only the entrypoint and
# the implementation lives in `server/`.
#
# `server/` is not a deployment surface, but its tests and tooling are still
# dead weight in the upload, and nothing here is reachable from api/vercel.ts.
server/**/__tests__/**
server/**/*.test.ts
server/vitest.config.ts
server/drizzle.config.ts
server/scripts/**
